msgid "DF1_D01_ABSTRACTION"
msgstr "This is a bounded work model with registered requests, accounts, services and policies. Actual outcomes come from the shared world handlers."

msgid "DF1_D01_BRIEF"
msgstr "It is your first night on service duty. I am Doyun, the field technician. One request reads a citizen's own receipt; another reads somebody else's. Turning off the server removes both. That is not our goal.\n\nConnect with the work account and observe a legitimate request first. Repair ownership checks, or close the exposed route and move legitimate work to a narrow delegation path. Check who can still work, not merely what disappeared.\nThe authorized work account is below. After connecting, the case tool shows current observations and permitted actions.\n\noperator@d01.defender.packet.test\nnight-duty\n"

